blic university created in 1991 member of the université paris-saclay Headquartered in Versailles. Founded 1991.", "newValue": "Université de Versailles Saint-Quentin-en-Yvelines (UVSQ), established in 1991, is a prominent French public university located in the historic city of Versailles. It emerged as a key component of the higher education reform in France during the late 20th century, aiming to enhance access to quality education and foster research. The university operates as a member of the prestigious Université Paris-Saclay, a consortium recognized for its academic excellence and innovation, which reflects the broader educational trends and policies in contemporary Western Europe.

